* `tabR`, `parR`: the generation tree of `g* ⊗ g*` (17689 tables) from `δ₁₃₂⊗δ₁₃₂` by `S_x`, `A_x`: level 0
  (7371, `V(2θ)`), level 1 (8778, `Λ²`), level 2 (1540); depth `≤ 4`;
* `UR`, `UcR`: the complement tables `U_r` (1344 × the `ψ`-dual of level 2; pairing denominator 224);
* `antiR`, `symR`: certificates for `24 (e_c⊗e_d - e_d⊗e_c)` (level ≤ 1) and
  `672 (e_c⊗e_d + e_d⊗e_c) - Σ_r ψ_r(c,d) U_r` (level 0); `psiR`: relations containing `{c, d}`;
* `colR`: bracket columns (checked against the rows `br = entry e7T`).
-/

